[h1]This mod has a successor: Dead Weight[/h1]
[b]Weight Scale is retired and will not be updated for Build 42.[/b]

It has been rebuilt from scratch as [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3804074600]Dead Weight[/url]:

[list]
[*]Built for Build 42, keeps Build 41 support.
[*]No item and no menu: just stand on the clinic scale and read your weight.
[*]A beam scale readout that slides and settles, in kg or lb.
[*]The Info tab now only shows a weight category, so the scale is the only way to see the exact number.
[*]Sounds, a "Step on Scale" option in the right click menu, splitscreen support, 28 languages.
[/list]

[b]The two mods are incompatible.[/b] Unsubscribe from this one and subscribe to Dead Weight instead. It is safe to swap on an existing save.

[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3804074600]Get Dead Weight here[/url]

